Z||000000||ChadMan||02-29-2000||03:08 PM||||Not to be confused with Calvin Klein's Obsession.  This pic is from 1996.  In 1997, he added nitrous to his Northstar.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/obsess1.jpg"> <BR>The text on the "trunk" panel says "To boldly go where no man has gone before."  And to my knowledge, John's was the first Northstar Fiero (correct me if I'm wrong).<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/obsess2.jpg"> <BR>The car is now metallic gray/purple with black rims and a targa roof.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Eric||02-29-2000||04:25 PM||||The paint is too much.  Looks like the space shuttle coming back into the atmosphere.||||reg||1
Z||000002||deceler8||02-29-2000||05:10 PM||||And it looks like a Dodge Shadow wing on the back.||||reg||1
Z||000003||stimpy||02-29-2000||09:52 PM||||"Waiter, these grapes are sour!" :P<P>I think this car is slicker than snot on a doorknob! And I believe that the IMSA body kit outdated the Dodge Shadow by about 6 years or so. ||||reg||1
Z||000004||olympic||02-29-2000||11:44 PM||||That car was featured in KitCar magazine a while back. The paint job is suppose to look like a comet entering the atmosphere. The car has the 300hp version of the northstar and a 120hp shot of nitrous. The tires on the back are something like 335/35/17. Plain huge.  The car does 0-60 mph in 4.8 sec without nitrous.  Say what you want but this is my dream fiero.||||reg||1
